OL,3,GNEWSATown traders plead for help over
OL,4,Ateen trouble-makers
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeil Walton, who runs gift and
OL,7,Fjewellery shop Iguazu Fair Trade, said
OL,8,Fhe was assaulted when a group climbed
OL,9,Fon to his roof and officers then
OL,10,Frefused to arrest anyone after taking
OL,11,F40 minutes to arrive.
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police said the
OL,14,Fdispersal order had led to a "very
OL,15,Fsignificant reduction in ASB
OL,16,F[anti-social behaviour] reports" but
OL,17,Fhas not yet responded to specific
OL,18,Fcriticisms.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
